<p>When you kill an enemy, their death forms a cursed magical pattern on the ground. This creates a circle of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 2, 3</acronym> which blinds enemies and deals them <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">17, 23, 27, 31, 34</acronym> light damage, while giving you 2 positive energy per turn. The circle lasts for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p><p>The duration of the circle can be increased by a critical hit.</p><p>The blind chance increases with your Spellpower.</p><p>You can activate this talent to draw the pattern in your own blood, creating it underneath you at the cost of 5% of your maximum life.</p><p></p>